  "Commercial use requires contact": "Pamakéan komérsial meredih kontak",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Dipesen saatos KTT Kaamanan AI Bletchley sareng dipingpin ku Yoshua Bengio kalayan langkung ti 100 ahli anu ngadamel kontribusi ti ampir 30 nagara, kitu ogé PBB, OECD, sareng Uni Éropa, laporan mandiri ieu ngahijikeun bukti ilmiah anu ayeuna aya ngeunaan kamampuan sareng résiko AI unggulan — nyatetkeun yén sababaraha sistem ayeuna tiasa ngadeteksi iraha aranjeunna keur diévaluasi sareng nyaluyukeun paripolahna sasuai.",
