  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Ngarobih déklarasi hak janten pasar lisensi anu tiasa jalan, tinimbang wéb binér muka/tutup.",
  "Copied ✓": "Disalin ✓",
