  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Posisi anu bener: draf panalungtikan mandiri, usulan protokol, sareng ékspérimén spésifikasi anu muka.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Ngalereskeun setelan standar samémehna: Bélgia (BE) ayeuna dipetakeun kana basa Walanda tinimbang basa Perancis — panyatur Flandria mangrupa mayoritas nagara éta (~60%) dibandingkeun panyatur Perancis Walonia (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Ngalereskeun setelan standar samémehna: Kazakhstan (KZ) ayeuna dipetakeun kana basa Kazakh tinimbang basa Rusia, kusabab ayeuna parantos aya tarjamahan Kazakh — jenis parobihan anu sami sareng parobihan Bélgia samémehna.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
