  "Custom tier": "Tingkat kustom",
  "Daily Nous reports on a retracted Journal of Medical Ethics submission containing multiple fabricated, AI-hallucinated references — complete with fake university affiliations and defunct email addresses — that the author reportedly left uncorrected even after being given a chance to fix proofs. The piece contrasts this with Bioethics, whose automated reference-checking would have caught the problem, and argues the real bottleneck isn't detection technology (one commenter's script flagged the fake citations in under a minute) but unpaid reviewer labor and publishing incentives that reward throughput over scrutiny.": "Daily Nous ngalaporkeun ngeunaan naskah anu ditarik deui ti Journal of Medical Ethics anu ngandung seueur rujukan palsu hasil halusinasi AI — lengkep kalayan afiliasi universitas palsu sareng alamat surél anu teu aktip deui — anu numutkeun kabar panulisna teu diréngsékeun sanaos parantos dipasihan kasempetan pikeun ngalereskeun bukti cétak (proof). Tulisan ieu ngabandingkeun sareng Bioethics, anu pamariksaan rujukan otomatisna sakuduna tiasa nyekel masalah ieu, sareng nétélakeun yén hambatan saleresna sanés téhnologi deteksi (skrip hiji komentator tiasa nandaan sitasi palsu éta kirang ti hiji menit), tapi tanaga panilai anu teu dibayar sareng insentif penerbitan anu ngahargaan volume tinimbang katalitian.",
  "Data free-riding vs. trillion-dollar AI valuations": "Pamakéan data tanpa mayar (free-riding) dibandingkeun pangajén AI dina skala triliunan dolar",
  "DeepMind CEO calls for an independent standards body to regulate frontier AI": "DeepMind CEO calls for an independent standards body to regulate frontier AI",
  "Demis Hassabis proposed a FINRA-style regulator for frontier model releases: labs would submit models for review up to 30 days before deployment, voluntary at first, with a path toward mandatory compliance in the US market.": "Demis Hassabis ngajukeun régulator gaya FINRA pikeun pangaluaran modél unggulan: laboratorium bakal ngajukeun modél pikeun ditinjau dugi ka 30 dinten saméméh dilaksanakeun, mimitina sacara sukarela, kalayan jalan ka arah kapatuhan wajib di pasar Amérika Sarikat.",
  "Denied": "Ditolak",
  "Deployable policy starter template": "Témplat awal kabijakan anu tiasa dipasang",
  "Deployable policy starter template at /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip — a minimal static site with the full machine-readable layer, ready for Cloudflare Pages or any static host.": "Témplat awal kabijakan anu tiasa dipasang di /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip — situs statis minimal kalayan lapisan pinuh anu tiasa dibaca ku mesin, siap kanggo Cloudflare Pages atanapi host statis mana waé.",
  "Deploying machine-readable policies on your site": "Masang kabijakan anu tiasa dibaca ku mesin dina situs anjeun",
  "Disclaimer": "Panolakan Tanggung Jawab",
  "Distinct from human UI, SEO, or plain APIs, the AI Ingestion & Capability Layer gives websites a machine-facing architecture: a Manifest Layer (entry points like /llms.txt and /ai/manifest.json), a Corpus Layer (machine-readable knowledge), a Capability Layer (agent-callable tools), and a Governance Layer (provenance, licensing, versioning). Static-first, upgradeable toward APIs and MCP. Note: in this paper AICL names the ingestion architecture; on this site's protocol pages AICL refers to the AI Content Licensing Layer.": "Béda ti UI manusa, SEO, atanapi API biasa, AI Ingestion & Capability Layer masihan situs web arsitéktur anu ngadeuheus ka mesin: Lapisan Manifés (titik asup saperti /llms.txt sareng /ai/manifest.json), Lapisan Korpus (pangaweruh anu tiasa dibaca ku mesin), Lapisan Kamampuan (parabot anu tiasa dipanggil ku agén), sareng Lapisan Tata Kelola (asal-usul, lisensi, versi). Utamana statis, tiasa ditingkatkeun ka arah API sareng MCP. Catetan: dina makalah ieu AICL nyebatkeun arsitéktur ingestion; dina kaca-kaca protokol situs ieu, AICL nujul kana Lapisan Lisensi Kontén AI.",
  "Do Large Language Models Possess a Theory of Mind? A Comparative Evaluation Using the Strange Stories Paradigm": "Do Large Language Models Possess a Theory of Mind? A Comparative Evaluation Using the Strange Stories Paradigm",
  "Docs": "Dokumén",
  "Docs / Examples": "Dokumén / Conto",
  "Document library": "Perpustakaan dokumén",
  "Does AI have rights — and which framings are even coherent?": "Naha AI gaduh hak — sareng raraga mana anu koherén?",
  "Download": "Undeur",
  "Draft status": "Status draf",
  "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026": "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026",
  "Educational demo: HMAC-SHA256 with a shared secret, showing request-bound, expiring, verifiable license tokens. Production tokens should be signed asymmetrically, with the publisher’s public key discoverable under /.well-known/.": "Démo pendidikan: HMAC-SHA256 kalayan rahasia anu dibagikeun, nunjukkeun token lisensi anu kaiket kana paménta, gaduh wates waktos, sareng tiasa diverifikasi. Token produksi kedah ditandatanganan sacara asimétris, kalayan kunci umum panerbit anu tiasa dipanggihan dina /.well-known/.",
  "Eight more /topics entries, this time researched by an AI agent rather than curated by hand — same rule as before: every source fetched and confirmed live, summaries an original paraphrase, before anything gets added. 14 entries total.": "Dalapan entri /topics deui, ayeuna diulik ku agén AI tinimbang dikurasi ku leungeun — aturan anu sami sareng samémehna: unggal sumber dicandak sareng dikonfirmasi hirup, ringkesan mangrupa parafrasa asli, saméméh nanaon ditambihkeun. Total 14 entri.",
  "Email": "Surél",
  "Emotion Concepts and Their Function in a Large Language Model": "Emotion Concepts and Their Function in a Large Language Model",
  "Empirical Research": "Panalungtikan Émpiris",
  "English edition →": "Édisi basa Inggris →",
  "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Mastikeun kabukaan tiasa dilaksanakeun sacara mesin — supados niat saé teu dipiceun salaku katidakpastian hukum.",
  "Epistemology": "Épistémologi",
