  "not permitted": "teu diwidian",
  "now": "ayeuna",
  "quotation — excerpt limits and attribution rules": "quotation — wates kutipan sareng aturan atribusi",
  "rag_use — retrieval-augmented generation, retention windows": "rag_use — retrieval-augmented generation, jandéla panahanan",
  "read_access — whether AI may fetch and read the content": "read_access — naha AI kénging nyandak sareng maca kontén",
  "redistribution — republishing or redistributing content or derivatives": "redistribution — nerbitkeun deui atanapi nyebarkeun deui kontén atanapi turunanana",
  "research pages & whitepapers": "kaca panalungtikan & whitepaper",
  "robots.txt and llms.txt govern access and visibility, not learning depth or use permissions. AIRS proposes expressing AI rights as a proportional, use-specific spectrum across ten dimensions — access, indexing, inference input, embedding, training, fine-tuning, distillation, memory, output, attribution/compensation. AILP translates this into /ai/rights-spectrum.json, letting creators declare granular permissions with compensation models ranging from free through license-required to revenue share.": "robots.txt sareng llms.txt ngatur aksés sareng katembongan, sanés kadaleman diajar atanapi idin pamakéan. AIRS ngajukeun nétélakeun hak AI salaku spéktrum anu sabanding sareng husus kana pamakéan ngaliwatan sapuluh diménsi — aksés, indeksasi, input inferénsi, embedding, latihan, fine-tuning, distilasi, mémori, kaluaran, atribusi/kompénsasi. AILP narjamahkeun ieu kana /ai/rights-spectrum.json, ngamungkinkeun kreator ngadéklarasikeun idin anu rinci kalayan modél kompénsasi ti gratis dugi ka meredih lisensi dugi ka babagi pamayaran.",
  "schema-invalid": "skéma-teu-valid",
  "schema-valid": "skéma-valid",
  "site guide for AI systems": "pituduh situs kanggo sistem AI",
  "summarization — summaries, with or without attribution": "summarization — ringkesan, kalayan atanapi tanpa atribusi",
  "this site’s AI content rights policy": "kabijakan hak kontén AI situs ieu",
  "this site’s license catalog": "katalog lisensi situs ieu",
  "training / fine_tuning / distillation — model internalization tiers": "training / fine_tuning / distillation — tingkat internalisasi modél",
  "training — model training and fine-tuning permission": "training — idin latihan modél sareng fine-tuning",
  "transformation — structured extraction and derivative works": "transformation — ékstraksi struktural sareng karya turunan",
  "undeclared — high-risk pipelines may exclude": "undeclared — jalur résiko luhur tiasa ngaluarkeun",
  "verbatim_memory — whether exact reproduction is permitted": "verbatim_memory — naha réproduksi persis diwidian",
  "versioned, citable, traceable": "diversikeun, tiasa disitir, tiasa dilacak",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” ayeuna diterbitkeun dina basa Inggris salaku édisi kanonik; naskah asli basa Tiongkok tetep sayogi, sareng duanana vérsi silih tumbulan.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "“Protocolized Openness” dikonfirmasi salaku makalah basa Inggris (kalayan bagian paralel basa Tiongkok) — teu direncanakeun tarjamahan misah.",
  "↑ live machine-readable policy of this site": "↑ kabijakan anu tiasa dibaca ku mesin situs ieu, langsung",
